{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/intnews/20261126/photo/bkn-20261126220018465-1126_00992_001_01p.jpg?20261126162736\"/><p>巴雷托戴上冠軍后冠。</p><p>第75屆環球小姐總決賽周二（24日）在波多黎各首府聖胡安舉行，東道主佳麗、育有一女的27歲本地社工巴雷托（Jennifer Barreto）擊敗115名選手奪冠，成為自該賽事2023年取消已婚及生育參賽限制後，史上首位摘得后冠的已婚媽媽。這也是波多黎各第6次贏得環球小姐冠軍，距上次奪冠已隔20年。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T14:23:55.103324+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":168,"images":1,"source":"東網 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T14:00:18+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T16:37:48.581468+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T14:17:25.538022+00:00","content_hash":"03204d580b849b15302c3997ccea06f2ccfa987c96590a5b728c66936f0e20cf","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}